{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25779","headline":"滁阳春日怀果园闲宴 · 李绅","name":"滁阳春日怀果园闲宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西园到日栽桃李，红白低枝拂酒杯。\n繁艳只愁风处落，醉筵多就月中开。\n劝人莫折怜芳早，把烛频看畏晓催。\n闻道数年深草露，几株犹得近池台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}